This is an unofficial community project. It is not an official Kyutai release
and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Kyutai.

This project implements the Kyutai Unmute model-server WebSocket protocol for
Apple Silicon MLX inference. It does not vendor, fork, or redistribute code
from the following upstream projects, but its protocol implementation was
written against their published sources:

  - Kyutai Unmute       https://github.com/kyutai-labs/unmute
  - Kyutai Moshi         https://github.com/kyutai-labs/moshi
  - Kyutai Delayed Streams Modeling
                          https://github.com/kyutai-labs/delayed-streams-modeling

No model weights are included in or redistributed by this repository. Weights
loaded at runtime (e.g. kyutai/stt-1b-en_fr-candle, kyutai/tts-1.6b-en_fr)
retain their original CC-BY-4.0 license from Kyutai; refer to the upstream
repositories for current licensing terms.

No voice samples are included in or redistributed by this repository either.
Voices (kyutai/tts-voices) are fetched at runtime and licensed per-directory
by Kyutai, not uniformly:

  - vctk/*, cml-tts/*, voice-donations/*  CC BY 4.0 (voice-donations/* is CC0)
  - unmute-prod-website/*                CC0, with three named exceptions:
                                          degaulle-2.wav (public domain),
                                          ex04_narration_longform_00001.wav
                                          (CC BY-NC 4.0), p329_022.wav
                                          (CC BY 4.0)
  - expresso/*, ears/*                   CC BY-NC 4.0 (non-commercial only)

This project's built-in default voice (TTS_DEFAULT_VOICE) is
unmute-prod-website/p329_022.wav, which is licensed CC BY 4.0, not CC0: it
uses a voice from the VCTK corpus (CSTR, University of Edinburgh), CC BY
4.0. This is a commercially-safe default (attribution provided in this
file), and a deliberate deviation from upstream moshi-server's own default
(unmute-prod-website/default_voice.wav, CC0) -- Nate's blind-audition pick,
not a correctness fix. CC0 alternatives remain available by setting
TTS_DEFAULT_VOICE to unmute-prod-website/default_voice.wav or any
voice-donations/* voice. See README.md's "Voice licensing" section for the
full table and source. Selecting an expresso/ or ears/ voice is an explicit
opt-in and is not licensed for commercial use.
